<Property name="Filter Locations">
<Description>
Filter Locations: (True = checked) This is used in conjunction with lookup tables. Since this is defaulting to false the lookup tables
will not be created at this time. If at a later date they are needed then both 
IHC.ITF.Process.Bpl.SunquestResultsHl7ToNovoLab.Lookup.FacilityFilter and
IHC.ITF.Process.Bpl.SunquestResultsHl7ToNovoLab.Lookup.RoomFilter will need to be created.</Description>
<Type>%Boolean</Type>
</Property>

<Property name="Filter on OBX-9 for Micro">
<Description>
Filter on OBX-9 for Micro: (True = checked) This is used to filter out Micro OBX's with a value of N. 
These are not results LAB wants sent to any end system. The OBX will be skipped but not the rest of the record.</Description>
<Type>%Boolean</Type>
</Property>

<Parameter name="SETTINGS">
<Default>Filter Locations:Additional,Filter on OBX-9 for Micro:Additional</Default>
</Parameter>

